/ A failed task fails the wait step; on error handles it as anywhere.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Fails", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- task.wait(Task=%task%); on.error(Key="Broke", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")])
- assert.equals(Expected="Broke", Actual=%caught%, Message="the task's failure fails the wait")

Fails
- error.throw(Message="it broke", Key="Broke")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Key%)
